WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,920
What do you want from this side of your belly?

2
00:00:01,920 --> 00:00:02,920
Resources for resources

3
00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:03,840
labor for resources

4
00:00:03,840 --> 00:00:04,840
Don't use your status and fame

5
00:00:04,840 --> 00:00:06,880
Yamai understands the promise she made after being rescued

6
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:12,530
Not even in front of her

7
00:00:12,530 --> 00:00:14,010
I can't stand it until it's so bad

8
00:00:14,010 --> 00:00:16,030
Don't be harsh when I look at the makeup.

9
00:00:16,030 --> 00:00:16,990
She said it unpleasantly

10
00:00:16,990 --> 00:00:19,190
But she was right about this, Sister Fei

11
00:00:19,190 --> 00:00:21,070
You also helped her talk on the island

12
00:00:21,070 --> 00:00:22,910
A watch does not have the space between a bottle of water

13
00:00:22,910 --> 00:00:25,510
We will only suffer a loss if we continue to use our outside identities to judge this place.

14
00:00:25,510 --> 00:00:26,910
I really want to change my food after that

15
00:00:26,910 --> 00:00:28,190
Can only carry things or work

16
00:00:28,190 --> 00:00:32,940
At least she made the rules clear to Sister Rouer

17
00:00:32,940 --> 00:00:35,060
Are you hiding something from us?

18
00:00:35,740 --> 00:00:36,660
Then I won’t ask

19
00:00:36,660 --> 00:00:37,780
Anyway, sooner or later you will know
